    APPEND |{ cl_abap_conv_in_ce=>uccp( '2013' ) }</span>`\}</td>\n        <td><pre class="sql">$\{s.sql.trim()\}</pre>$\{s.error && html`<div class="notice err small">$\{s.error\}</div>`\}</t| TO parts.
    APPEND |d>\n        <td><button class="link small" title="Download the statement, formatted"\n          onClick=$\{() => download(sqlStatementScript(s, s.n), `$\{name\}-$\{s.n\}.sql`, 'tex| TO parts.
    APPEND |t/plain')\}>Download</button></td>\n      </tr>`;\n    \})\}</tbody>\n  </table>`;\n\}\n\n// The SQL statements a call ran: in the order they ran or the slowest first, each with it| TO parts.
    APPEND |s phase and the element of\n// the query that read it (a click shows it in the query plan: onNode, onPhase). children: more buttons for the bar.\nexport function SqlView(\{ call, o| TO parts.
