    APPEND |ton disabled=$\{busy\} onClick=$\{() => onSwitch('off', u.user)\}>Switch off</button></td>\n        </tr>`)\}</tbody>\n      </table>` : html`<div class="muted">The trace is off fo| TO parts.
    APPEND |r every user.</div>`\}\n      <div class="notice info small">A call is traced under the SAP user it runs as. This page runs as$\{' '\}\n        <span class="mono">$\{state.user\}</| TO parts.
    APPEND |span>; while the ICF node <span class="mono">/zzxxmla1</span> logs on anonymously,\n        every XMLA call runs as that user too. The client's address and User-Agent tell the call| TO parts.
