    APPEND |    setTab((t) => (!t \|\| (t === 'mdx' && !e.mdx) \|\| (t === 'plan' && e.method !== 'EXECUTE')\n        ? (e.method === 'EXECUTE' ? 'plan' : e.mdx ? 'mdx' : 'request') : t));\n  | TO parts.
