    APPEND |(entry) ? ' for' : ''\} <span class="mono">$\{entry.type\}</span>`\}</h2>\n      <span class="muted small">$\{time(entry.at)\} { cl_abap_conv_in_ce=>uccp( '00B7' ) } $\{entry.user| TO parts.
